帛，檐揭而去。徒用所賜錢帛，取少婦於長安中好女。率取婦一歲所者即棄去，更取婦。所賜錢財盡索之於女子。人主左右諸郎半呼之「狂人」。人主聞之，曰：「令朔在事無為是行者，若等安能及之哉！」朔任其子為郎，又為侍謁者，常持節出使。朔行殿中，郎謂之曰：「人皆以先生為狂。」朔曰：「如朔等，所謂避世於朝廷閒者也。古之人，乃避世於深山中。」時坐席中，酒酣，據地歌曰：「陸沈於俗，避世金馬門。宮殿中可以避世全身，何必深山之中，蒿廬之下。」金馬門者，宦者署門也，門傍有銅馬，故謂之曰「金馬門」。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji126-004","interpretation_note":"依明示父子接家族根，不補子姓名，分支不表示排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","mention_count":17,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0007","c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0032","c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0216","c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0234","c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0253","c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0273","c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0278","c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0142","c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0045","c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0051","c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0105","c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0119","c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0189","c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0003","c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0066","c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0082","c-shiji-126-huaji:m027-0042"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-126-huaji:p015","c-shiji-126-huaji:p016","c-shiji-126-huaji:p017","c-shiji-126-huaji:p018","c-shiji-126-huaji:p027"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":5}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji126-huaji"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji126-004","subject_person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p015","quote":"武帝時，齊人有東方生名朔，以好古傳書，愛經術，多所博觀外家之語。朔初入長安，至公車上書，凡用三千奏牘。公車令兩人共持舉其書，僅然能勝之。人主從上方讀之，止，輒乙其處，讀之二月乃盡。詔拜以為郎，常在側侍中。數召至前談語，人主未嘗不說也。時詔賜之食於前。飯已，盡懷其餘肉持去，衣盡汙。數賜縑帛，檐揭而去。徒用