在上，德流天下，諸侯賓服，威振四夷，連四海之外以為帶，安於覆盂，天下平均，合為一家，動發舉事，猶如運之掌中。賢與不肖，何以異哉？方今以天下之大，士民之眾，竭精馳說，并進輻湊者，不可勝數。悉力慕義，困於衣食，或失門戶。使張儀、蘇秦與仆并生於今之世，曾不能得掌故，安敢望常侍侍郎乎！傳曰：『天下無害菑，雖有聖人，無所施其才；上下和同，雖有賢者，無所立功。』故曰時異則事異；雖然，安可以不務修身乎？《詩》曰：『鼓鐘于宮，聲聞于外。鶴鳴九皋，聲聞于天。』苟能修身，何患不榮！太公躬行仁義七十二年，逢文王，得行其說，封於齊，七百歲而不絕。此士之所以日夜孜孜，修學行道，不敢止也。今世之處士，時雖不用，崛然獨立，塊然獨處，上觀許由，下察接輿，策同范蠡，忠合子胥，天下和平，與義相扶，寡偶少徒，固其常也。子何疑於余哉！」於是諸先生默然無以應也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"諸先生","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"5pz_90e_hzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"vsm_g44_lxu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"聖帝","kind":"person","person_id":"kq8_9zr_p86","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0142","start":142,"end":145,"surface":"東方生","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"vsm_g44_lxu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"5pz_90e_hzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"聖帝","kind":"person","person_id":"kq8_9zr_p86","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0359","start":359,"end":361,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"vsm_g44_lxu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0362","start":362,"end":364,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"5pz_90e_hzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0483","start":483,"end":485,"surface":"太公","kind":"person","person_id":"39x_aqh_sst","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0495","start":495,"end":497,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"vlq_85b_6qa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0557","start":557,"end":559,"surface":"許由","kind":"person","person_id":"fyj_7r5_9ws","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0562","start":562,"end":564,"surface":"接輿","kind":"person","person_id":"n1d_kk9_jkd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0567","start":567,"end":569,"surface":"范蠡","kind":"person","person_id":"ibh_9if_1dv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0572","start":572,"end":574,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"qme_5ae_ovf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0605","start":605,"end":608,"surface":"諸先生","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p017","text":"建章宮後閤重櫟中有物出焉，其狀似麋。以聞，武帝往臨視之。問左右群臣習事通經術者，莫能知。詔東方朔視之。朔曰：「臣知之，願賜美酒粱飯大飱臣，臣乃言。」詔曰：「可。」已又曰：「某所有公田魚池蒲葦數頃，陛下以賜臣，臣朔乃言。」詔曰：「可。」於是朔乃肯言，曰：「所謂騶牙者也。遠方當來歸義，而騶牙先見。其齒前后若一，齊等無牙，故謂之騶牙。」其後一歲所，匈奴混邪王果將十萬眾來降漢。乃復賜東方生錢財甚多。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"kq8_9zr_p86","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"東方朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"kq8_9zr_p86","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0119","start":119,"end":120,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0174","start":174,"end":177,"surface":"混邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"rht_70o_mfq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0189","start":189,"end":192,"surface":"東方生","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p018","text":"至老，朔且死時，諫曰：「《詩》云：『營營青蠅，止于蕃。愷悌君子，無信讒言。讒言罔極，交亂四國。』願陛下遠巧佞，退讒言。」帝曰：「今顧東方朔多善言？」怪之。居無幾何，朔果病死。傳曰：「鳥之將死，其鳴也哀；人之將死，其言也善。」此之謂也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"kq8_9zr_p86","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"kq8_9zr_p86","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"東方朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p027","text":"滑稽鴟夷，如脂如韋。敏捷之變，學不失詞。淳于索絕，趙國興師。楚優拒相，寢丘獲祠。偉哉方朔，三章紀之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji: